{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1325824-connections-and-contacts-the-same","id":1325824,"title":"Connections and Contacts the same?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-18T19:36:39-07:00","id":1325824,"title":"Connections and Contacts the same?","content":"So my impression from Trinity Core was that the &quot;Connections&quot; you choose from your Paths were different from &quot;Contacts&quot;. Is that true.. do you get Connections, Skills, Edges, and a Contact from each Path? Connections being &quot;Metropolis High School&quot; and Contacts being &quot;Lex Luthor&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25494-robskylor","name":"Robskylor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25494_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T20:02:24-07:00","id":1325832,"title":"","content":"Connections are the source of your contact basically. You have a connection to the Aeon Society, and the guy that helps you inside is your contact.<br /> <br /> That\u2019s my understanding at least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T05:49:42-07:00","id":1325950,"title":"","content":"But they are separate? You pick one and then the other? I pick &quot;Lab Class&quot; as a Connection and then &quot;Dean McCalister&quot; as my contact..? I can exhaust one and still tap the other? That was my impression of how it works, but in the Abberant Kickstarter updates, a Dev posted a character creation quick start guide, and each of his Connections were basically Contacts and I was worried I was misunderstanding the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25494-robskylor","name":"Robskylor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25494_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T06:23:38-07:00","id":1325962,"title":"","content":"They are not independent.<br /> <br /> Let\u2019s imagine you have connection to the police, you know many of the guys in the department, but the guy who really helps you is Detective McGuffin, he is your contact in the police, he is the guy that you \u201ccontact\u201d when you need \u201cconnection\u201d to the police.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T06:34:34-07:00","id":1325963,"title":"","content":"Okay, cool. Thanks for the explanation. Maybe I'm being dense, I've got a pretty good grasp on most of the book.. for some reason no matter how many times I read the Contacts section I couldn't make this click.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25494-robskylor","name":"Robskylor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25494_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T07:23:54-07:00","id":1325974,"title":"","content":"The book PS are not very technical, they are more narrative focused, so you must read several parts of it and have as pretty good idea of how RPG works to get many things.<br /> <br /> Most of the others rpg books have a glossary or something explaini